# =================================================================================================
# Agent's Player to Club Model -- .gitignore
#
# Written against this project's actual structure (not a generic template). The deployed Streamlit
# app (dashboard/app.py) reads exactly 4 CSVs from production/recommendation_engine/results/ -- see
# dashboard/app_config.py / dashboard/data_loader.py. Everything else under production/ is either
# build-time source (.py scripts, kept -- they document/reproduce the pipeline) or generated
# research/intermediate data (excluded below -- large, not needed at runtime, regenerable from the
# source scripts).
# =================================================================================================

# --- Local backup, never part of the project ---
.pre_gcs_v4_backup/

# --- Python ---
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.pytest_cache/

# --- Virtual environments ---
venv/
.venv/
env/

# --- IDE / OS ---
.vscode/
.idea/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# --- Secrets / local env (defensive -- none currently exist in this project) ---
.env
.env.*
*.pem
*.key
credentials.json

# --- Logs / temp ---
*.log
*.tmp

# --- Legacy / superseded work ---
Archive/

# --- Research, experiments, intermediate/build outputs (regenerable from production/*/*.py) ---
production/*/research/
production/style_compatibility/results/
production/level_and_opportunity/results/
production/club_pattern_model/results/
production/player_evaluation_integration/results/
production/agent_mapping/results/
production/scope_and_eligibility/results/

# NOTE: production/recommendation_engine/results/ is intentionally NOT ignored above -- it holds
# the 4 CSVs the deployed dashboard reads at runtime (players.csv, recommendations.csv,
# explanations.csv, league_coverage.csv) plus a small (~1KB) build-time stats file. Do not add a
# blanket production/*/results/ rule without this exception, or the deployed app's own data goes
# missing from the repo.
